Z||000000||Cozmo||06-27-2001||09:18 AM||||I picked up a couple of wings at the boneyard to experiment with (cheep, $15 ea).<BR>Here is a 1st. gen. MR2 wing on the Duke Coupe...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mr2oncoupe.JPG"> <BR>Here is the same wing on the GT...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mr2ongt.JPG"> <BR>I didn't realize how much narrower GTs are in the back end than coupes.  The MR2 wing fits totally on the decklid on the coupe while on the GT the outer wing supports actually sit on the fenders.  The MR2 wing would fit with no mods on the coupe, if anything it is about 2"-3" too narrow.  To fit it on the GT would take some serious surgery.  After numerous beers, myself and my fellow Fieroheads have decided that the MR2 wing does kinda look good...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Here is a Firebird wing on the Targa...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/birdontarga.JPG"> <BR>The unique problem the Targa has is that I need to keep the luggage rack to store the targa top on when I'm on the road (otherwise it stays in the garage and I bring a tarp with me).  I'm thinking of using the bird wing with parts of the old luggage rack, with a little bit of "finessing" I think I can make it look almost factory, plus I got the 3rd. brake light too.<P>These are just some crazy ideas, don't bash me too bad for playing with MR2 parts.  Just being creative and havin' fun ya know...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cozmosig.jpg"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||fierobaby||06-27-2001||09:52 AM||||after long (a whole minute) time string at those pics I can conclude yes the MR2 wing is UGLY!!!! lol not sure about the other one I can't decide.... I personally like the bigger ing that stands out more like my OME wing although mine is made for the Firo maybe I'll go find on of the P.T. Cruiser wings and see how it looks!||||reg||6
Z||000002||mrfixit58||06-27-2001||05:14 PM||||On the coupe, I think the MR2 spoiler looks a lot like the IMSA spoiler. Of course I would have to see it in person and preferably through beer goggles.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Got that garage fridge hooked up yet?<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy :D<BR>87 GT   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cozmo||06-27-2001||06:40 PM||||I'm definitely going to use the 'bird wing on the Targa, as soon as I can get a couple more center stanchions from another luggage rack I'm going to put it on.  It'll fit with no drilling or mods, so if I don't like it I can take it off.<BR>As far as the MR2 wing, I dunno.  Probably gets thrown on the shelf for some future project.<BR>  Maybe we should post one of the pics on the MR2 board??? :eek<BR>mrfixit58... the fridge <B>does</B> work fine, it gets checked a LOT. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I'll be having another "tech session" real soon, you can check it out...<BR><B>C02M0</B> ||||reg||3
